    "title": "COLUMNIST: JD Vance's Hard Road to 2028 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Byron York ,\n3 hours ago Vice President JD Vance faced an impossible task trying to negotiate an end to the U.S.-Israeli war against Iran. That Vance failed is no surprise, given Iran’s so-far implacable resistance to the demand that it abandon its nuclear weapons program. That, Vance said, is President Donald Trump’s “core goal” of the war. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
